Package: assignmentB2AndresOcampo
Title: Count Missing Values for All Columns by Group
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Andres", "Ocampo", , "andresocampo1228@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides count_all_missing_by_group(), a convenient wrapper
    around dplyr::group_by() and dplyr::summarize() that returns the number
    of missing values in every column of a data frame, broken down by a
    grouping variable.
